/P 132 0 R
/E (The young learners participated enthusiastically, transforming discarded materials into attractive and useful creations. Their imaginative ideas and artistic efforts reflected their resourcefulness and ability to give a new purpose to items that might otherwise have been thrown away.)
/Pg 14 0 R
