/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
271 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 132 0 R
/E (Through this hands-on experience, children learnt that creativity can turn ordinary waste into extraordinary creations. They were encouraged to look at discarded objects differently and discover their hidden potential. The activity also promoted independent thinking, problem-solving skills and the joy of learning by doing. Such initiatives help develop eco-friendly habits from an early age and inspire children to make thoughtful choices in their daily lives.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
