/E (An insightful School Connect 3.0 Awareness and Guidance Session was conducted at Dr. Mar Theophilus School, Dhanori, Pune, in collaboration with AISSMS Institute of Information Technology \(AISSMS IOIT\), Pune. The session was organised with the objective of creating awareness among students about higher education opportunities and helping them make informed decisions about their future academic and career pathways.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
488 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 140 0 R
/E (The session was conducted by Ms. Suprriya Lohar, Assistant Professor, Department of Electronics and Telecommunication Engineering, AISSMS IOIT, Pune. The interaction focused on various aspects of engineering education, emerging technologies, higher education opportunities, career avenues, and the skills required to succeed in the rapidly evolving professional world.)
